#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/NavigationHistoryEntry.cpp lines 23-40 (create, the
#       constructor, initialize) with the inline session_history_entry of
#       NavigationHistoryEntry.h. The JS-facing getters (url, key, id, index, sameDocument,
#       getState, ondispose) are phase 3.
